  "question": {
    "text": "Given :\n$\\mathrm{XNa}_2 \\mathrm{HAsO}_3+\\mathrm{YNaBrO}_3+\\mathrm{ZHCl} \\rightarrow \\mathrm{NaBr}+\\mathrm{H}_3 \\mathrm{AsO}_4+\\mathrm{NaCl}$\nThe values of $\\mathrm{X}, \\mathrm{Y}$ and $\\mathrm{Z}$ in the above redox reaction are respectively :",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "ky7Wn",
      "text": "\n$2,1,2$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "nkZeJ",
      "text": "\n$2,1,3$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "uInoj",
      "text": "\n$3,1,6$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "iVo6M",
      "text": "\n$3,1,4$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "On balancing the given reaction, we find\n$3 \\mathrm{Na}_2 \\mathrm{HAsO}_3+\\mathrm{NaBrO}_3+6 \\mathrm{HCl}\\longrightarrow 6 \\mathrm{NaCl}+3 \\mathrm{H}_3 \\mathrm{AsO}_4+\\mathrm{NaBr}$",
